{"id":"ho31u271ufb6n1hib4swquhsi","title":"超冷原子分子物理专题：揭示量子世界新现象","originalTitle":"专题 | 超冷原子分子物理（I）一","summary":"《物理学报》组织策划了“超冷原子分子物理”专题，涵盖原子分子冷却、量子涨落效应、量子计算等多个方向。专题文章详细研究了6 Li费米原子在p-波Feshbach共振中的三体重组动力学，揭示了异自旋原子对中间准束缚分子态的跨组分敏感响应。此外，研究还展示了射频相位调控下冷原子内态的相干拉比振荡动力学过程，实现了高精度的耦合强度操控。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3427348&do=blog&id=1561726"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:15.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T10:02:56.615Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T10:02:56.615Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","量子计算","Nature"],"score":48,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"quantum-computing","name":"量子计算"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}